      "created_at": "2017-12-07T18:22:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't know how many of these people would agree with, but my friends &amp; I have had this discussion a lot so I've got a short Cast List</p><p>Bunker: Josh Hutcherson</p><p>Absolute Zero: Alan Tudyk</p><p>Grand Warlord Voss: Tom Hardy</p><p>First Lieutenant Vyktor: Domonic Monaghan</p><p>Field Lieutenant Tamar: Gina Carano</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Expatriette: Sophie Cookson</p><p>Setback: Josh Krasinski</p><p>Nightmist: Aubrey Plaza</p><p>Mister Fixer: Rob Morgan</p><p>Zhu Long: Jet Li</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
