      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Under3\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/48/1872_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Under3:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Expatriette should clearly be played by Gwendoline Christie, she's got the appropriate stature and badassness.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Not arguing her badassness, but I thought Expatriette was shorter than that…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>edit</em></p>\n<p>actually, i checked it &amp; I'm a bit confused… cause in her Bio she's 6'1\". but on Quick draw it shows her just a bit shorter than Ambuscade who's bio says he's 5'8\" so either they pulled some Robert Downey Jr stuff on him for that frame or Expatriette's Bio is off… &amp; that's the only card i could find that has a good LoS perspective that works for a comparison, on Don't Dismiss Anything she's kneeling &amp; on Rites of Rebirth the perspective isn't set right for a comparison</p>",
